OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a light shower at
OL,6,Ffirs across the Perthshire hills.
OL,7,FOtherwise it will be a dry day with
OL,8,Fvariable amounts of cloud and some
OL,9,Fbright or sunny intervals.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be mainly
OL,12,Fdry, just the odd shower across the
OL,13,Fwest. The rest of the night will see a
OL,14,Ffew showers in the west, but dry in
OL,15,Feast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FMainly cloudy with some
OL,18,Fshowery rain across the west. Largely
OL,19,Fdry elsewhere with the best of any
OL,20,Fbright spells along the east coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
