OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Saturday with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Falthough the east will be dry. Patchy
OL,8,Frain at first on Sunday, then dry. Dry
OL,9,Fon Monday.
